# Maestro (Android emulator)

- Install: Maestro + JDK 17 (same as iOS); Android SDK platform-tools (`adb`); Play Store AVD with Chrome (`com.android.chrome`)
- Ready check: `yarn check:android` (`scripts/android-emulator-ready.sh`)
- Run: `yarn test:maestro:android` — wrapper sets JDK PATH, `APP_ID=com.android.chrome`, `adb reverse` → `APP_URL=http://localhost:<port>`
- Keyboard (Chrome): `yarn test:maestro:android:keyboard` — light then dark; screenshots `maestro-android-keyboard-{,dark-}{closed,open,closed-after}`
- Keyboard (PWA): `yarn test:maestro:android:pwa:keyboard` — install once, then same light+dark shots (`maestro-android-pwa-keyboard-*`)
- PWA install: `yarn test:maestro:android:pwa` — in-app **Install Hork** → **Install app** → native **Install** → **Add to home screen**. `adb reverse` + `http://localhost` is a secure context (Vite LAN works). Prefer clearState so a prior dismiss does not hide the banner
- Shared product steps: `maestro/shared/{login-steps,ensure-light-mode,ensure-dark-mode,ensure-signed-in}.yaml` (`APP_ID` env)
- Open helpers: `android-chrome-open.yaml` (clearState + FRE); `android-chrome-open-soft.yaml` (no clear); `android-chrome-dismiss-fre.yaml`
- Do **not** put `androidWebViewHierarchy: devtools` on FRE/open steps — it can hide native Chrome welcome UI
- Android keyboard shots: `android-keyboard-shots.yaml` (dismiss via `pressKey: back`). Dismiss install banner first — it covers the composer and steals taps
- Android WebView often omits input placeholders — tap labels (`Phone number`, `Group name`) not `(555)…` / `WWDC…`
- Dismiss Account sheet: prefer `Close`; if missing (Android standalone ActionSheet), swipe down — never Android `back` (leaves the group)
- Overrides: `APP_URL=http://…` or `MAESTRO_PORT=4173`
- **`clearState` is OK** on Chrome (unlike Safari) — login/PWA flows clear Chrome state at launch
- Prefer `adb reverse` + `http://localhost:<port>` (secure context). Fallback `http://10.0.2.2:<port>` is not a secure context
- Keep the emulator process in a long-lived shell (`wait`) — agent shells that exit can reap `qemu` even with `nohup`
- Screenshots: `takeScreenshot: artifacts/…` lands under `~/.maestro/tests/<run>/<flow>/takeScreenshot/artifacts/` (repo `artifacts/` is gitignored). Always copy from the newest run dir by mtime
- Test OTP: `555-01XX` + `555555` with `AUTH_ALLOW_TEST_OTP` (local or **quacker-dev** only — never prod)
- Agent exploration: Android MCP (`@moallemi/android-mcp-server` in `~/.cursor/mcp.json`) — screenshot / UI tree / tap — parallel to `ios-simulator` MCP
- Sibling iOS rules: `.cursor/rules/maestro-ios.mdc`
